            <ArticleTitle>Detection of ventricular thrombi by ultrasound.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>309-12</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Left ventricular mural thrombi have certain characteristics in location and accoustical appearance that permit their detection by two dimensional echocardiography. We report our experience in the detection of cardiac thrombus by ultrasound.</AbstractText>
